        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of floral woven figured silk. The ground is very pale pink in colour which on this is woven a repeat pattern of roses (deeper pink than the ground), hawthorne (black with pink blossoms) and cherry blossom (pink picked out in black). Each spray of roses and branches is connected to its successor by a branch of cherry blossoms."@en ;
